Upstream Hashdeep notice
------------------------

Upstream states that, except for identified bundled components, Hashdeep is
a work of the United States Government and is not eligible for U.S.
copyright protection under 17 USC 105. Upstream's Tiger code is from
libgcrypt under GNU GPL terms. Its bundled PolarSSL SHA-1 source states GNU
GPL version 2 or later. Hashdeep FZ does not compile upstream Tiger code.

The complete original upstream notice and GNU GPL version 2 text are in the
upstream `COPYING` file at pinned revision
877613493ff44807888ce1928129574be393cbb0. NOTICE and UPSTREAM_VERSION.md
identify all incorporated work. Firmware mbedTLS is governed by its own
upstream license as distributed with the Flipper firmware SDK.
